<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - BASS target upped at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BASS target upped at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Monday it had raised its price target on brewing-to-hotels group Bass Plc to 925p from 900p and added the stock to its European &quot;priority&quot; list, upgrading it from its &quot;recommended&quot; list.  </p>
<p>Earlier the stock rose to a near four-month high amid talk of an upgrade from Goldman. Bass shares were up 11p at 832-1/2 by 1208 GMT.</p>
<p>Goldman analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
